WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:08.425
Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.401 --> 00:00:11.690
I'm a chameleon.

3
00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.950
We are colorful lizards.

4
00:00:15.802 --> 00:00:18.042
Where do you live?

5
00:00:19.063 --> 00:00:21.656
We mostly live in Africa.

6
00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:25.272
Some chameleons live in the desert.

7
00:00:25.938 --> 00:00:29.599
But most live in African rain forests.

8
00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.390
I like your colors!

9
00:00:37.557 --> 00:00:40.472
We can change our colors to communicate.

10
00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:44.589
Changing colors helps us stay hot or cool.

11
00:00:45.415 --> 00:00:49.138
Our green skin helps us hide in trees.

12
00:00:51.314 --> 00:00:53.644
You're a good climber.

13
00:00:55.731 --> 00:00:59.203
Our toes help us grip branches.

14
00:00:59.722 --> 00:01:02.019
Our tails help too.

15
00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:05.600
We can wrap them around things.

16
00:01:09.104 --> 00:01:11.717
What do chameleons eat?

17
00:01:12.548 --> 00:01:15.492
We eat insects like crickets and grasshoppers.

18
00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.967
Big chameleons eat other lizards and birds.

19
00:01:22.483 --> 00:01:26.088
You have a long, sticky tongue!

20
00:01:26.977 --> 00:01:29.586
We can shoot our tongues out fast. See?

21
00:01:33.365 --> 00:01:36.486
We use our tongues to catch insects.

22
00:01:37.414 --> 00:01:40.525
Do your eyes help you find food?

23
00:01:41.535 --> 00:01:44.342
Yes. Our eyes work very well.

24
00:01:46.253 --> 00:01:49.023
Each eye can move in a different direction.

25
00:01:50.703 --> 00:01:53.527
So we can see two things at once.

26
00:01:55.944 --> 00:01:58.417
There's a cricket. Yum!

27
00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:02.057
Good-bye, Chameleon!

